          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "What Is a Brand Logo?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>A <strong>brand logo</strong> is a logo designed as part of a complete brand identity, not as a standalone graphic. It reflects the business's personality, values and target customers, and it sets the colors, fonts and style used across every other brand asset.</p><p>Your brand story is what separates you from competitors and explains the benefits of your products or services. A brand logo is the fastest way to communicate that story at a glance.</p>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
