          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "How Brand Logo Design Works",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<ol><li><strong>Share your logo vision</strong>: your name, story, audience and styles you like.</li><li><strong>Receive concepts</strong>: several custom options covering different directions.</li><li><strong>Refine your favorite</strong>: revise until it fits. You can even switch to a different concept.</li><li><strong>Build the identity</strong>: colors and fonts are set and applied to your first materials.</li></ol><p>Concepts are usually delivered the same day, by email or text message.</p>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
