           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "Logo vs. Brand Identity: What Is the Difference?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<div><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"></th><th scope=\"col\">Logo Only</th><th scope=\"col\">Brand Logo + Identity</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>What you get</strong></td><td>A single mark</td><td>Logo, color palette, typography and applications</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Consistency</strong></td><td>Depends on who uses it</td><td>Defined rules keep every item consistent</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Best for</strong></td><td>A quick first mark</td><td>Businesses planning to grow, advertise or open a location</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
