          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "Brand Logo FAQs",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "What should I prepare before starting a brand logo?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Have your business name, a short description of what you do, your ideal customers, and a few logos or colors you like. Logo Austin designers can guide you through the rest in a free consultation.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Can I change direction after seeing concepts?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Yes. You can request revisions, combine ideas from different concepts, or ask for a completely different direction before approving the final logo.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "How much does a logo cost at Logo Austin?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Custom logo design at Logo Austin is priced from $125 to $175. There is no upfront charge; you pay only after you approve the final design.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Do you help with business names?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Yes. Naming support is part of Logo Austin's brand identity service, and designers check that the name works well visually as a logo.</p>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
